       🤖 ScanBot Manager v1.0
=========================================
📋 Commands:
  1. Start bot (background)     ← Start the bot in the background
  2. Scan now (one-time)        ← Perform an immediate scan
  3. Show status                ← Display the current status
  4. Stop bot                   ← Stop the bot
  5. Exit                       ← Exit the application
